<title>LATVIA: TRANZITU BANKA FIVE MONTH PROFIT 910,890 LATS.</title>
<headline>TRANZITU BANKA FIVE MONTH PROFIT 910,890 LATS.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Baltijas Tranzitu Bank, among the 10 biggest banks in terms of assets, on Wednesday said that its five month profit came to 910,890 lats.</p>
<p>The bank said in a statement that its assets came to 58.65 million, a rise by 7.29 million lats from the end of 1996, and its own capital rose by 73,000 lats to 8.41 million lats.</p>
<p>The bank also said that it has deposits worth 34.11 million lats and has granted credits worth 19.95 million lats.</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
